  "steps": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large pot over medium heat and cook the onion for 5 minutes until soft.",
    "Stir in the garlic, tomato paste, sun-dried tomatoes, Italian seasoning and red pepper flakes and cook 1 to 2 minutes.",
    "Add the broth and chicken, bring to a simmer, and cook 15 to 20 minutes until the chicken is cooked through.",
    "Move the chicken to a plate and shred it with two forks.",
    "Add the pasta to the pot and simmer 8 to 10 minutes until tender.",
    "Return the chicken to the pot, then stir in the cream and parmesan and warm through for 2 minutes.",
    "Season with salt and pepper, then serve topped with basil, extra parmesan and a pinch of red pepper flakes."
  ],
